# Missing entirely until now — without this, `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile
# was sending .git history, any local node_modules/.next build artifacts,
# etc. into the Docker build context and image layers. On a 10GB droplet
# already tight on space (see Dockerfile's own comment on the "no space
# left on device" fix), this is real, avoidable waste.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
.next
out
npm-debug.log*
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
*.md
.vscode
.idea
